                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;1. Audit log filter&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;a Signals configuration is setup and in use for data generation&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the administrator accesses audit log in the configuration module&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the System shall display the audit log with the following characteristics:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The filter must allow to filter on User&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The filter must allow to filter on data range&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The filter must allow to filter on Resource Type&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The filter must allow to filter on Resource Name&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The filter must allow to filter on Event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
